{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 0.82, "end_time_s": 3.28, "duration_s": 2.46, "text": "Alvia, est-ce que tu as vu les factures ?", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 3.79, "end_time_s": 5.49, "duration_s": 1.7, "text": "Oui, je les ai triées sur le bureau.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 5.84, "end_time_s": 8.16, "duration_s": 2.32, "text": "J'ai entendu un bruit étrange dans le salon.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 8.47, "end_time_s": 10.8, "duration_s": 2.33, "text": "C'est probablement juste le frigo.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 11.39, "end_time_s": 19.49, "duration_s": 8.1, "text": "Non, je suis sûre que c'était une porte.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 19.65, "end_time_s": 24.18, "duration_s": 4.53, "text": "Alexa, éteins les lumières du salon.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 24.47, "end_time_s": 27.54, "duration_s": 3.07, "text": "Merci, je cherchais de quoi écrire.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 28.03, "end_time_s": 30.53, "duration_s": 2.5, "text": "Les factures sont sous le classeur bleu.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 31.08, "end_time_s": 33.77, "duration_s": 2.69, "text": "Alvia, pourrais-tu vérifier la caméra ?", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 34.31, "end_time_s": 37.32, "duration_s": 3.01, "text": "Il n'y a personne dehors, je viens de regarder.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 37.72, "end_time_s": 45.84, "duration_s": 8.12, "text": "Deirdre, tu as vu mon écharpe ?", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 46.28, "end_time_s": 56.81, "duration_s": 10.53, "text": "Elle est sur le canapé, près du coussin.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 56.5, "end_time_s": 59.38, "duration_s": 2.88, "text": "Deirdre, tu connais bien la maison alors.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 59.89, "end_time_s": 61.62, "duration_s": 1.73, "text": "Elle passe plus de temps ici que nous.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 61.82, "end_time_s": 64.67, "duration_s": 2.85, "text": "Alvia, allume la musique douce, s'il te plaît.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 61.94, "end_time_s": 66.76, "duration_s": 4.82, "text": "Est-ce que tu as vu la liste de courses ? Je crois que j'ai oublié de noter les œufs.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 65.08, "end_time_s": 67.63, "duration_s": 2.55, "text": "Ça commence à être un peu tard pour moi.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 67.21, "end_time_s": 72.84, "duration_s": 5.63, "text": "Oui, je l'ai écrite sur le frigo. Et tu as aussi oublié de vérifier la météo pour ce soir.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 67.91, "end_time_s": 72.74, "duration_s": 4.83, "text": "Dis, tu as vu où j'ai mis mes clés ? Je ne les trouve nulle part.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 67.91, "end_time_s": 72.76, "duration_s": 4.85, "text": "Tu as vu l'heure? On va être en retard pour le rendez-vous chez le dentiste.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 72.95, "end_time_s": 84.58, "duration_s": 11.63, "text": "On rentre tous bientôt, ne t'inquiète pas.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 73.33, "end_time_s": 77.28, "duration_s": 3.95, "text": "Ah oui, c'est vrai. Echo, qu'est-ce qu'il fait dehors ce soir ?", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 77.47, "end_time_s": 83.77, "duration_s": 6.3, "text": "Il pleuvra, donc on sortira pas le chien. Par contre, as-tu remarqué que la lampe du salon clignote un peu ?", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 84.3, "end_time_s": 88.51, "duration_s": 4.21, "text": "Oui, c'est bizarre. Alexa, quelle est la température intérieure ?", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 84.89, "end_time_s": 110.49, "duration_s": 25.6, "text": "Calme-toi, il est seulement 14h45. On a encore le temps de finir le café.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 85.16, "end_time_s": 92.79, "duration_s": 7.63, "text": "Elles sont probablement sur la table basse, comme d'habitude.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 89.06, "end_time_s": 93.99, "duration_s": 4.93, "text": "Elle est stable à 22 degrés. C'est peut-être juste un problème de connexion, comme pour Deirdre.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 93.33, "end_time_s": 104.21, "duration_s": 10.88, "text": "Echo, verrouille la porte d'entrée.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 93.63, "end_time_s": 101.07, "duration_s": 7.44, "text": "Deirdre ? Tu parles de la nouvelle collègue de ton frère ?", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 101.56, "end_time_s": 107.51, "duration_s": 5.95, "text": "Non, l'assistant vocal de la voisine, celui qui s'appelle Deirdre. Il a eu le même bug hier.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 104.54, "end_time_s": 109.38, "duration_s": 4.84, "text": "J'ai regardé, elles ne sont pas là. Alexa, où sont mes clés ?", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 107.7, "end_time_s": 111.6, "duration_s": 3.9, "text": "Ah, c'est intéressant. Echo, ferme les stores du salon.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 109.91, "end_time_s": 112.8, "duration_s": 2.89, "text": "Bonne nuit à tous, merci pour l'aide.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 110.99, "end_time_s": 115.04, "duration_s": 4.05, "text": "Oui, mais il faut qu'on prépare les affaires de Léa en même temps.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 111.97, "end_time_s": 117.52, "duration_s": 5.55, "text": "Attends, on a besoin de lumière pour lire les recettes. Alexa, allume la lampe de bureau.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 113.35, "end_time_s": 125.09, "duration_s": 11.74, "text": "Ah, tu as mis la balise sur ton porte-clés.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 114.44, "end_time_s": 129.08, "duration_s": 14.64, "text": "J'y pense! Echo, lance un minuteur de dix minutes pour les clés.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 118.08, "end_time_s": 123.46, "duration_s": 5.38, "text": "Ok, d'accord. Donc, Deirdre est plus fiable que notre Echo apparemment.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 123.83, "end_time_s": 129.43, "duration_s": 5.6, "text": "Il répond mieux aux ordres en anglais, je suppose. Et puis, il a un nom plus original.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 125.42, "end_time_s": 129.26, "duration_s": 3.84, "text": "Oui, mais l'application dit qu'elles sont dans la cuisine.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 129.42, "end_time_s": 133.92, "duration_s": 4.5, "text": "C'est bien, comme ça on ne traîne pas. Tu prends le parapluie?", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 129.51, "end_time_s": 155.97, "duration_s": 26.46, "text": "C'est bizarre. Attends, je vais vérifier. Echo, allume la lumière de la cuisine.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 129.98, "end_time_s": 133.85, "duration_s": 3.87, "text": "Deirdre... c'est un beau nom. Je vais peut-être changer le mien un jour.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 134.14, "end_time_s": 139.42, "duration_s": 5.28, "text": "Oui, il y a des nuages, mais je ne suis pas sûre qu'il pleuve.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 134.25, "end_time_s": 137.61, "duration_s": 3.36, "text": "Fais attention, Echo pourrait refuser si le nom est trop long.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 137.85, "end_time_s": 140.01, "duration_s": 2.16, "text": "Alexa, renomme-moi en Deirdre.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 139.85, "end_time_s": 143.2, "duration_s": 3.35, "text": "Alexa, quel temps fait-il à Paris ce soir?", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 140.38, "end_time_s": 144.97, "duration_s": 4.59, "text": "Elle a accepté ! Bon, maintenant, va mettre leTimer pour les pâtes.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 143.67, "end_time_s": 150.3, "duration_s": 6.63, "text": "Elle dit qu'il y a 40% de risques d'averse vers 18h.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 145.54, "end_time_s": 150.2, "duration_s": 4.66, "text": "Timer pour 10 minutes. C'est fait. On est sauvés.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 149.71, "end_time_s": 153.95, "duration_s": 4.24, "text": "Je vais prendre le parapluie au cas où, au bureau aussi.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 150.66, "end_time_s": 155.49, "duration_s": 4.83, "text": "Presque. Il ne reste plus qu'à trouver Deirdre une solution pour ses lumières.", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 154.11, "end_time_s": 169.91, "duration_s": 15.8, "text": "Bonne idée. Tu as mis les billets de la caisse?", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 156.3, "end_time_s": 160.39, "duration_s": 4.09, "text": "Merci. Je commence à m'inquiéter, je vais être en retard.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 160.83, "end_time_s": 170.09, "duration_s": 9.26, "text": "Ne t'inquiète pas, ça va le faire. Regarde juste sous le tapis.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 170.4, "end_time_s": 173.75, "duration_s": 3.35, "text": "Oui, ils sont dans la poche gauche de ma veste.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 170.57, "end_time_s": 172.57, "duration_s": 2.0, "text": "Attends... oh ! Elles sont là !", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 173.16, "end_time_s": 192.1, "duration_s": 18.94, "text": "Les fakers m'ont encore eu ! Ce tapis cache bien le jeu.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 174.1, "end_time_s": 190.99, "duration_s": 16.89, "text": "Parfait. Et Léa, elle est prête?", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 191.46, "end_time_s": 195.16, "duration_s": 3.7, "text": "Elle est dans sa chambre, en train de chercher ses chaussettes.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 192.46, "end_time_s": 197.41, "duration_s": 4.95, "text": "Haha, oui. Tu sais, j'ai lu un article sur les fausses clés aujourd'hui.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 194.83, "end_time_s": 203.43, "duration_s": 8.6, "text": "Léa! On y va dans cinq minutes, ne cherche pas partout!", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 197.93, "end_time_s": 204.81, "duration_s": 6.88, "text": "Ah bon ? C'est quoi le truc ?", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 203.86, "end_time_s": 207.82, "duration_s": 3.96, "text": "Tu veux qu'Alexa mette de la musique pour l'aider à se dépêcher?", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 205.22, "end_time_s": 212.22, "duration_s": 7.0, "text": "Des clés qui ont l'air normales mais qui ne fonctionnent pas. On appelle ça des \"alvia\" dans certains cercles.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 208.3, "end_time_s": 220.59, "duration_s": 12.29, "text": "Non, pas maintenant, on y va déjà.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 212.81, "end_time_s": 226.28, "duration_s": 13.47, "text": "Alvia ? Je n'ai jamais entendu ce terme.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 220.84, "end_time_s": 225.73, "duration_s": 4.89, "text": "Ok. Je vais la chercher. Tu mets la lumière du couloir?", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 225.27, "end_time_s": 237.6, "duration_s": 12.33, "text": "Oui, Alexa, allume la lumière du couloir.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 226.7, "end_time_s": 232.81, "duration_s": 6.11, "text": "C'est une marque récente de clés de sécurité. Deirdre en a acheté un set la semaine dernière.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 233.21, "end_time_s": 244.17, "duration_s": 10.96, "text": "Deirdre ? Elle est là en ce moment ?", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 238.03, "end_time_s": 240.76, "duration_s": 2.73, "text": "Merci. On part quand tu as tes chaussures?", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 240.91, "end_time_s": 254.28, "duration_s": 13.37, "text": "Je mets mes escarpins, c'est plus rapide. On y est.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 244.34, "end_time_s": 248.39, "duration_s": 4.05, "text": "Oui, elle est dans le salon. Elle nous attend pour le dîner.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 248.11, "end_time_s": 267.21, "duration_s": 19.1, "text": "D'accord, je vais y aller. Alexa, éteins les lumières du salon.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 267.42, "end_time_s": 270.51, "duration_s": 3.09, "text": "Bonne idée. Elle va être contente de te voir.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 269.94, "end_time_s": 282.18, "duration_s": 12.24, "text": "J'espère qu'elle a préparé ce fameux plat aux fakers.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 282.55, "end_time_s": 286.04, "duration_s": 3.49, "text": "Oui, c'est son spécialité. On y va ?", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 286.64, "end_time_s": 299.47, "duration_s": 12.83, "text": "Allons-y. Echo, lance la playlist de dîner.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 299.24, "end_time_s": 301.68, "duration_s": 2.44, "text": "Parfait. On arrive Deirdre !", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 301.93, "end_time_s": 311.1, "duration_s": 9.17, "text": "Ça y est, on est là. Bonjour Deirdre !", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 311.57, "end_time_s": 316.75, "duration_s": 5.18, "text": "Salut Deirdre, désolée du retard, on cherchait les alvia pour le dessert.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 316.99, "end_time_s": 344.29, "duration_s": 27.3, "text": "Pas de souci, tu sais que les fakers sont toujours là quand on en a besoin. Alexa, allume les lumières douces.", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_1", "speaker_name": "Speaker 1", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 344.78, "end_time_s": 351.79, "duration_s": 7.01, "text": "Les lumières du salon s'allument toutes seules, c'est incroyable. Echo, allume les lumières de la cuisine.", "speaker_position": [2.47, 1.05, 1.73], "speaker_size": 0.33}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_2", "speaker_name": "Speaker 2", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 352.29, "end_time_s": 356.71, "duration_s": 4.42, "text": "Oui, et regarde, l'assistant vient de nous dire que deirdre a commandé le gâteau.", "speaker_position": [3.44, 3.76, 1.8], "speaker_size": 0.2}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_3", "speaker_name": "Speaker 3", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 356.21, "end_time_s": 359.38, "duration_s": 3.17, "text": "Attends, deirdre ? Elle n'est pas censée être en retard ?", "speaker_position": [4.36, 3.4, 1.75], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_4", "speaker_name": "Speaker 4", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "normal", "start_time_s": 359.67, "end_time_s": 364.11, "duration_s": 4.44, "text": "Non, elle a utilisé le code alvia pour passer commande plus vite.", "speaker_position": [2.5, 2.38, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.0}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_5", "speaker_name": "Speaker 5", "gender": "female", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "laughter", "start_time_s": 364.52, "end_time_s": 371.64, "duration_s": 7.12, "text": "C'est drôle, moi j'ai l'impression que ce sont des fakers qui gèrent tout depuis la maison.", "speaker_position": [6.62, 1.99, 1.77], "speaker_size": 0.27}
{"speaker_id": "speaker_6", "speaker_name": "Speaker 6", "gender": "male", "language": "fr", "vocal_style": "interruption", "start_time_s": 371.39, "end_time_s": 403.04, "duration_s": 31.65, "text": "Peut-être, mais au moins le dîner sera prêt à l'heure. Echo, quel est le temps qu'il fait dehors ?", "speaker_position": [5.16, 4.92, 1.71], "speaker_size": 0.4}
